    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starcatcher</strong> is a fast-paced hack 'n' slash action &quot;roguelite&quot; where you play as the Star God as you fight your way out of a cosmic liminal space between worlds. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486000/extras/055d581a06455941fad6a7bfdf646686.poster.avif?t=1754421072\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486000/extras/055d581a06455941fad6a7bfdf646686.webm?t=1754421072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486000/extras/055d581a06455941fad6a7bfdf646686.mp4?t=1754421072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay the minions of the Angel of Madness, collect Stardust and trade it with the stars for a variety of items and spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death left this &quot;world&quot; and nothing can truly die since then. Upon being defeated, the flames of death return you to the start. Rise and try again,</p>",
